  "title": "Homemade Pita Chips",
  "description": "These pita chips are brushed with olive oil and herbs before they're baked for a lovely crunchy snap that you can't get from a store-bought bag.",
  "authors": [
    "Dawn"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-04T16:48:19-05:00",
