  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon garlic salt",
    "1 teaspoon dried chervil",
    "0.5 teaspoon dried basil",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "12 pita bread pockets"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line two rimmed baking sheets with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7xxisvVTfutFp75TwX8GL72v1TU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14827-Pita-Chips-DDMFS-Step-1-6a0d36d443f94bee8e3eb582420ec78a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14827/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix oil, garlic salt, chervil, basil, and pepper together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZMYtxqE2OelYox9h4BZ4nPJkLrk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14827-Pita-Chips-DDMFS-Step-2-2fad76e050e142aa8e55223782d462a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14827/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each pita bread into 8 triangles using a sharp knife or pizza cutter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6I71xccGmEIFKDTnNO80WSc_vx8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14827-Pita-Chips-DDMFS-Step-3-4cc86227434249e8b30d91cc50e09244.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14827/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange some pita triangles in a single layer on each of the prepared baking sheets; brush with oil mixture. Not all will fit, so set remaining triangles aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iH5gNlbVbBNDlp6RtaDphxs_kFs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14827-Pita-Chips-DDMFS-Step-4-a31e07d458174760bde90d722d8b7625.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14827/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake on two racks of the preheated oven until lightly browned and crispy, about 7 minutes, switching halfway through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vL1AzaQWuswHAL7_tW973rQxHNs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14827-Pita-Chips-DDMFS-Step-5-510a2ff4299b4391bd45942b0c791808.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14827/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer pita chips to a serving platter and repeat Steps 4 to 5 with remaining triangles and oil mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1vQTx49Cia31_dBkPUQ9e7RDMAY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-14827-Pita-Chips-DDMFS-4x3-2d820a34bd2044b3a89ecd724591858b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14827/step_06.webp"
    }
